  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:10a61345c0b08310c5696a11ad37e171
    SourceText: <i>Wait.</i> The pattern repeats every seven seconds. Someone wanted us to find it.
    Translations:
    - Locale: es
      Text: <i>Wait.</i> The pattern repeats every seven seconds. Someone wanted us to find it.
      NeedsReview: 1
  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:10a61345c0b08310c5696a11ad37e171:speaker
    SourceText: Mara
    Translations:
    - Locale: es
      Text: Mara
      NeedsReview: 1
  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:7ea4d2c6b87513970d6a6817a31620eb
    SourceText: <b>There it is.</b> The light is answering us. <link="novelify-wave">Keep moving.</link>
    Translations:
    - Locale: es
      Text: <b>There it is.</b> The light is answering us. <link="novelify-wave">Keep moving.</link>
      NeedsReview: 1
  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:7ea4d2c6b87513970d6a6817a31620eb:speaker
    SourceText: Mara
    Translations:
    - Locale: es
      Text: Mara
      NeedsReview: 1
  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:9ba6f71ff21ba92f09adbe293339b7be
    SourceText: '<size=125%><b>THE LAST SIGNAL</b></size>

      The observatory has been dark for years. Tonight, a pale light returns to its window.'
    Translations:
    - Locale: es
      Text: '<size=125%><b>THE LAST SIGNAL</b></size>

        The observatory has been dark for years. Tonight, a pale light returns to its window.'
      NeedsReview: 1
  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:f3ae2328d3196bbb6677d56c073f0a7a
    SourceText: A signal pulses across the ridge. <i>What will you do?</i>
    Translations:
    - Locale: es
      Text: A signal pulses across the ridge. <i>What will you do?</i>
      NeedsReview: 1
  - Key: a9159106e6923964f8a50c44a777e9a0:f3ae2328d3196bbb6677d56c073f0a7a:choice:explore
    SourceText: Follow the signal
